      * FIXED-FORMAT SAMPLE: SEQUENCE AREA, INDICATOR COLUMN, COPYBOOK
000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. FIXEDPRG.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500 01 WS-REC.
000600     COPY CUSTREC REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CUST==.
000700 01 WS-FLAG             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
000800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000900 MAIN-PARA.
001000     ACCEPT WS-REC
001100* MINORS WITH A HIGH LIMIT ARE REVIEWED
001200     IF CUST-AGE < 18
001300        AND CUST-LIMIT > 1000
001400         MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FLAG
001500     END-IF
001600     DISPLAY "WS-FLAG=" WS-FLAG
001700     STOP RUN.
